  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expert advice QUISP extension 2015-2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konsultst&#xF6;d QUISP f&#xF6;rl&#xE4;ngning 2015-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sverige har gett st&#xF6;d till utveckling av Ugandas kvalitetsinfrastruktur inom ramen f&#xF6;r programmet &quot;Quality Infrastructure and Standrards Programme&quot;, QUISP. Syftet &#xE4;r att de institutioner och regelverk som &#xE4;r en del av kvalitetsinfrastrukturen, dvs omr&#xE5;den s&#xE5;som standardisering, ackreditering, certifiering och m&#xE4;tning, ska uppfylla internationella krav och regelverk. En v&#xE4;l fungerande kvalitetsinfrastruktur fr&#xE4;mjar Ugandas regionala och internationella handel samt &#xF6;kar den nationella konsuments&#xE4;kerheten. Avtalet med QUISP avs&#xE5;g perioden 2010 - 2014 men utbetalningarna har stoppas vid olika tillf&#xE4;llen pga restriktioner i Sveriges samarbete med den ugandiska staten. Ambassaden har nu f&#xE5;tt godk&#xE4;nt att f&#xF6;rl&#xE4;nga avtalet med Uganda avseende QUISP, utan att tillf&#xF6;ra nya medel, f&#xF6;r att m&#xF6;jligg&#xF6;ra att slutf&#xF6;ra de aktiviteter som planerats inom programmet. Syftet med detta avrop av konsulttj&#xE4;nster &#xE4;r att Handelsministeriet i Uganda samt ambassaden ska f&#xE5; tekniskt st&#xF6;d i denna f&#xF6;rl&#xE4;ngning s&#xE5; att f&#xF6;rv&#xE4;ntade resultat av programmet kan s&#xE4;kerst&#xE4;llas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden has supported the development of Uganda&apos;s quality infrastructure within the framework of the  &quot;Quality Infrastructure and Standards Programme&quot;, QUISP. The aim is that institutions, regulations and the legal framework that are part of the quality infrastructure (standardization, accreditation, certification and metrology) is in accordance with international requirements and regulations. A well-functioning quality infrastructure promotes Uganda&apos;s regional and international trade and improves local consumer protection. The agreement regarding QUISP covered the period 2010 - 2014 but implementation has been delayed caused by restrictions in payments of Swedish funds. The agreement will now be extended at no-cost to honor the committment made by Sweden and to secure delivery of expected and sustainable results. The purpose of the consulting services is to provide technical advice to the Ministry of Trade and the Embassy in the extension in order to ensure that reusults of the program can be reached.</narrative>
  </description>
